{"ticker":"RSG","updated":"2026-10-30T23:10:37Z","profile":{"longName":"Republic Services, Inc.","shortName":"Republic Services, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Waste Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.republicservices.com","fullTimeEmployees":42000,"marketCap":74728218624,"trailingPE":34.6156,"forwardPE":30.237398,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.4241443,"pegRatio":3.06,"targetMeanPrice":245.375,"targetHighPrice":272.0,"targetLowPrice":208.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.046,"earningsGrowth":0.051,"grossMargins":0.43035,"operatingMargins":0.20429,"profitMargins":0.12942,"totalRevenue":16890999808,"beta":0.397,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":248.71,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":196.41,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.13},"summary":"Republic Services, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, offers environmental services in the United States and Canada. It is involved in the collection and processing of recyclable, solid waste, and industrial waste materials; transportation and disposal of non-hazardous and hazardous waste streams; and other environmental solutions. Its residential collection services include curbside collection of material for transport to transfer stations, landfills, recycling centers, and organics processing facilities; supply of recycling and waste containers; and renting of compactors. The company also engages in the processing and sale of old corrugated containers, old newsprint, aluminum, glass, and other materials; and provision of landfill services. It serves small-container, large-container, and residential customers. The company was incorporated in 1996 and is based in Phoenix, Arizona.","summary_zh":"Republic Services, Inc. 及其子公司在美國和加拿大提供環境服務。涉及可回收物、固體廢物、工業廢料的收集和處理；無害和有害廢物流的運輸和處置；和其他環境解決方案。其住宅收集服務包括路邊收集材料，以便運送到中轉站、垃圾掩埋場、回收中心和有機物處理設施；供應回收和廢棄物容器；以及壓實機的租賃。本公司也從事舊瓦楞紙箱、舊新聞紙、鋁、玻璃等材料的加工和銷售；以及提供堆填區服務。它為小型貨櫃、大型貨櫃和住宅客戶提供服務。該公司成立於 1996 年，總部位於亞利桑那州鳳凰城。","sector