andfills.","zh":"以收入衡量，Republic Services 是北美最大的環境服務提供者之一。我們在美國和加拿大設有 377 個收集工廠、255 個轉運站、79 個回收中心、207 個活躍垃圾填埋場、2 個處理、回收和處置設施、24 個處理、儲存和處置設施 (TSDF)、5 個鹽水處理井、15 個深注入井、9 個工業廢水處理設施和 2 個聚合物中心。我們參與了 84 個垃圾掩埋場天然氣發電和其他再生能源項目，並負責 124 個關閉的垃圾掩埋場的關閉後工作。"},{"en":"We believe the total addressable United States and Canada environmental services market in which we operate generates approximately $163 billion of annual revenue, which includes the $110 billion recycling and waste industry, $37 billion of the broader environmental solutions industry, and $16 billion in sustainability innovation (described below) and emerging waste and recycling technologies. Within our recycling and waste business, we prioritize investments in market verticals with above-average growth rates and higher return profiles. The environmental solutions market remains fragmented, which provides consolidation opportunities to drive scale. In our sustainability innovation businesses, we believe customer demand for products and services that respond to evolving environmental trends, including circularity and decarbonization, should support above average growth rates and attracti","zh":"我們相信，我們經營的美國和加拿大環境服務市場總收入約為 1,630 億美元，其中包括 1,100 億美元的回收和廢棄物產業、370 億美元的更廣泛的環境解決方案產業，以及 160 億美元的永續發展創新（如下所述）和新興廢棄物和回收技術。在我們的回收和廢棄物業務中，我們優先投資成長率高於平均和回報率較高的垂直市場。環境解決方案市場仍然分散，這提供了擴大規模的整合機會。在我們的永續發展創新業務中，我們相信客戶對響應不斷變化的環境趨勢（包括循環和脫碳）的產品和服務的需求應該支持高於平均水平的成長率並吸引"},{"en":"We operate throughout the United States and Canada, but the physical collection and recycling or disposal of material is largely a local business, and the dynamics and opportunities differ in each market we serve. By combining local operating management with standardized business practices, we drive greater overall operating efficiency across the Company while maintaining day-to-day operating decisions at the local level, closest to the customer.","zh":"我們的業務遍及美國和加拿大，但材料的實際收集、回收或處置主要是本地業務，而且我們服務的每個市場的動態和機會都不同。透過將本地營運管理與標準化業務實踐相結合，我們提高了整個公司的整體營運效率，同時在最貼近客戶的本地層面維持日常營運決策。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Expansion of Recycling Capabilities - Based on the most recent United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) data, approximately 32% of municipal solid waste is recycled and/or composted. We expect that percentage to increase over the long-term as communities enhance and expand their recycling programs for their residents. As a key player in the circular economy, we are strategically focused on expanding recycling volume through innovative material handling processes and programs to help our customers achieve their goals related to sustainability and environmentally sound practices while also generating an appropriate return. In 2024, we commenced operations at our first Polymer Center in Las Vegas, Nevada. In 2025, we commenced operations at our second Polymer Center in Indianapolis, Indiana and construction began at our third Polymer Center in Allentown, Pennsylvania. Our Polymer","zh":"擴大回收能力 - 根據美國環保署 (EPA) 的最新數據，大約 32% 的都市固體廢棄物被回收和/或堆肥。我們預計，隨著社區加強和擴大居民的回收計劃，從長遠來看，這一比例將會增加。作為循環經濟的關鍵參與者，我們的策略重點是透過創新的材料處理流程和計劃擴大回收量，幫助我們的客戶實現與永續發展和環保實踐相關的目標，同時產生適當的回報。 2024 年，我們在內華達州拉斯維加斯的第一個聚合物中心開始運作。 2025 年，我們位於印第安納州印第安納波利斯的第二個聚合物中心開始運營，位於賓夕法尼亞州阿倫敦的第三個聚合物中心也開始建設。我們的聚合物"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a competitive industry. Competition in the environmental services industry comes from a few other large, national publicly-owned companies, several regional publicly- and privately-owned companies and thousands of small privately-owned companies. In any given market, competitors may have larger operations and greater resources. In addition, we","zh":"我們在一個競爭激烈的行業中運作。環境服務業的競爭來自其他一些大型全國性上市公司、一些地區性上市和私人公司以及數千家小型私人公司。在任何特定市場中，競爭對手可能擁有更大的業務和更多的資源。此外，我們"},{"en":"compete with municipalities that maintain material collection or disposal operations. These municipalities may have financial advantages due to the availability of tax revenue and greater opportunities for tax-exempt financing.","zh":"與維持材料收集或處置業務的市政當局競爭。由於稅收收入和免稅融資的更多機會，這些城市可能具有財務優勢。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Recycling & Solid Waste Segments","val":16874000000,"zh":"回收和固體廢棄物部門"},{"name":"Group1Segment","val":8630000000,"zh":"組1段"},{"name":"Group2Segment","val":8244000000,"zh":"組2段"},{"name":"Group3Segment","val":1784000000,"zh":"組3段"}],"total":19027000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Collection Service Line","val":11233000000,"zh":"代收服務專線"},{"name":"Collection Service Line Smallcontainer","val":5055000000,"zh":"收集服務線小貨櫃"},{"name":"Landfill Service Line","val":3202000000,"zh":"垃圾掩埋場服務專線"},{"name":"Collection Service Line Largecontainer","val":3098000000,"zh":"代收服務專線大櫃"},{"name":"Collection Service Line Residential","val":3010000000,"zh":"收款服務專線 住宅"},{"name":"Transfer Service Line","val":1833000000,"zh":"接送服務專線"},{"name":"Environmental Solutions Service Line","val":1828000000,"zh":"環境解決方案服務線"},{"name":"Other Service Line","val":824000000,"zh":"其他服務專線"},{"name":"Other Service Line Sale Of Recycled Commodities","val":433000000,"zh":"其他服務線回收商品銷售"},{"name":"Other Service Line Other Noncore","val":391000000,"zh":"其他服務線 其他非核心"}],"total":19027000000}},"peers":["WCN","ROP","PH","RHI","WM"]}}